                                               "text":  "Cthulhu, Hastur, J\u0027zahar, Yog-Sothoth, Azathoth, Nyarlathotep, and Shub-Niggurath are not interchangeable masks. Each name belongs to a different current of power, and the rites that answer one may reject another. The statues preserve these distinctions in stone. Learn the mark before offering a charm or beginning a working."
